+  // patch 0219 (T48 iter-8): emit a raw SysEx byte stream to the MPU-401
+  // (each byte via SDL_DOSMpu401WriteByte, so SDL/0097's per-byte DRR poll
+  // paces it -- the no-poll overrun regime is what made WBTEST-003's resets
